[["heading","SECTION 24 / COMPARISON\nUndo and recovery decision table"],["sinhala","","තමන්Jගේ changes JකාJහද තිJයන්Jන් කියලා බලලා නිවැරදි command එක Jතහෝරන්න.",428],["heading","Situation\nCommand / action\nEffect"],["text","Unstage a file\ngit restore --staged file\nKeep working edit"],["text","Discard unstaged edit\ngit restore file\nCopies index to work tree;\ndestructive"],["text","Undo unpublished tip, keep staged\nchanges\ngit reset --soft HEAD~1\nMove HEAD; index unchanged"],["text","Undo unpublished tip, keep edits\nunstaged\ngit reset --mixed HEAD~1\nMove HEAD and reset index"],["text","Discard tracked changes and move\ntip\ngit reset --hard target\nDestructive; sandbox only for\nlearning"],["text","Undo published bad commit\ngit revert commit\nNew inverse commit"],["text","Find old local tip\ngit reflog; git branch rescue ID\nRecover reachable object if\navailable"],["text","Abort unfinished merge / rebase\ngit merge --abort / git rebase --\nabort\nAttempt to return to pre-operation\nstate"],["heading","Inspect first"],["code","git status -sb\ngit diff\ngit diff --staged\ngit log --oneline --graph --all"],["text","Save needed work before undoing. Recovery is not guaranteed for uncommitted changes discarded\nby destructive commands."]]